# Rust
/target
/src-tauri/target
/src-tauri/gen
**/*.rs.bk

# Node / Tauri CLI
node_modules/
dist/

# First-run DSH runtime (installed by scripts/ensure-dsh.ps1, never committed)
runtime/

# Local logs / state
*.log
updates/
.DS_Store

# Update staging
*.sig.tmp

# Sandbox-local tooling / npm cache (workspace-local, never committed)
.npm-cache/
.tmp/
.tools/

# Release manifest (generated by scripts/release.ps1)
/latest.json

# 项目凭证层（`.dsh/` 接入模式时生成）——**必须忽略**。
# 2026-09-20 补：此前没有任何规则忽略它，`git check-ignore -v .env` 退出码 1，
# 往 `.env` 里填真凭证后 `git add -A` 会直接把它带走。
# 真凭证的推荐落点是 ~/.dsh/.credentials.yaml；本文件只放本项目覆盖值与环境差异。
.env

# 模式的临时产物（两态划分里属"闭环直接删除"），不入库
.dsh/tmp/
.dsh/reports/
